acco Survey (GYTS). Estonian country report</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www2.tai.ee/uuringud/Tubakas/Est_report.pdf"/></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ward</surname><given-names>KD</given-names></name><name><surname>Weg</surname><given-names>MW Vander</given-names></name><name><surname>Relyea</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Debon</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Klesges</surname><given-names>RC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Waterpipe smoking among American military recruits</article-title><source>Prev Med</source><year>2006</year><volume>43</volume><fpage>92</fpage><lpage>97</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16675003</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.ypmed.2006.03.010</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>